WEBVTT

00:00:59.118 --> 00:01:03.877
The 100 girls project
tells us some really nice statistics.

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:07.414
For example, for every 100 girls
that are suspended from school,

00:01:07.438 --> 00:01:10.358
there are 250 boys
that are suspended from school.

00:01:10.382 --> 00:01:12.705
For every 100 girls
who are expelled from school,

00:01:12.729 --> 00:01:15.529
there are 335 boys
who are expelled from school.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.427
For every 100 girls in special education,

00:01:18.451 --> 00:01:20.133
there are 217 boys.

00:01:20.642 --> 00:01:22.843
For every 100 girls
with a learning disability,

00:01:22.867 --> 00:01:24.590
there are 276 boys.

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:29.747
For every 100 girls
with an emotional disturbance diagnosed,

00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:31.541
we have 324 boys.